WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Brother Changsheng, eight guns

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:09,750
If a fight really breaks out, we won't be able to withstand one round.

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:13,126
Count you ten

4
00:00:13,126 --> 00:00:18,190
Pretending even when death is imminent

5
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:24,660
The bear's bile is mine, and so is this dog

6
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:28,330
You beast, follow me, stew and eat meat

7
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:32,320
How dare you touch my dog?

8
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,320
Play with a gun with me in the old bear collar's snow lair

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:38,920
I'll kill you
